The default group is visible and public with the default image running_01. The body is the web form payload. Garmin also accepts a body without an image.
-- args --
groups
create
E2E Club
--description
Sunday runs
--location
Berlin
-- route POST /group-service/group --
{"id":2002,"groupName":"E2E Club"}
